  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During the Luo Po Valley breakout, a mysterious black-robed Gu Immortal’s robe is torn and Old Lord Can Yang names the Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance physique. That holder is a rank seven immortal zombie who carries one of the ten extreme physiques. Old Lord Can Yang, a fire path Gu Immortal, is countered by the physique and put at a disadvantage.",
      "chapters": [
        925
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_luo_po_valley",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_old_lord_can_yang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Broader set rules sit on Ten Extreme Physique.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ten_extreme_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pu Wan Dao calls the same immortal zombie a ten extreme immortal zombie with outstanding battle strength and says Zombie Alliance headquarters has sent down a top-priority order to rescue him from Old Ancestor Xue Hu. Corpse Detonation King separately says the body holds an abundance of fire path and lightning path dao marks and is extremely suited for Gu refinement.",
      "chapters": [
        929
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-marks-and-rescue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_pu_wan_dao",
        "fac_zombie_alliance",
        "char_old_ancestor_xue_hu",
        "char_corpse_detonation_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Old Ancestor Xue Hu returns the still-sleeping immortal zombie to Blazing Heaven Demoness as part of a deal ending his conflict with Zombie Alliance, unable to extract its Immortal Gu: an unknown immortal killer move keeps it asleep, and forcing the issue would trigger self-detonation in both the zombie and the Immortal Gu inside its aperture.",
      "chapters": [
        945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "custody-and-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_blazing_heaven_demoness",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At Yi Tian Mountain, the black-robed formation member answers a tsunami with a lava world that evaporates thirty-meter waves. Southern Border Gu Immortals then name him a ten extreme immortal zombie, Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance.",
      "chapters": [
        968
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lava-burst",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "char_blazing_glory_lightning_brilliance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan names the same mysterious Gu Immortal an immortal zombie of Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance Physique while watching Shadow Sect’s side at Lang Ya.",
      "chapters": [
        979
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "named-at-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Luo Po Valley falls, Fang Yuan recalls that during the battle of Yi Tian Mountain this immortal zombie acted as a formation core inside the ten extreme immortal zombie lifeless formation, and that Qin Bai Sheng and Jiang Yu had kept him alive as a crucial member.",
      "chapters": [
        989
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-core",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_fairy_jiang_yu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Luo Po Valley falls, the immortal zombie escapes again and sneaks into Earth Trench, where it discovers Old Ancestor Xue Hu stealing immortal zombie corpses; the resulting battle ends with the zombie captured once more and Xue Hu exposed to Zombie Alliance’s anger.",
      "chapters": [
        990
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "escape-and-second-capture",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_earth_earth_trench"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Bai Xiang heavenly spirit tells Bai Ning Bing that Blazing Glory Lightning Brilliance Physique would fit a humans-alike-dragons refinement better than Northern Dark Ice Soul Physique, and later repeats that the physique, or cultivation of transformation path or refinement path, would raise the chance of surviving that method.",
      "chapters": [
        1227
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dragon-refinement-fit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "sys_northern_dark_ice_soul_physique"
      ]
    }
